b. Keen to return to workplace. Employer supportive.\n\n               Fit to work certificate issued: return to work possible with amended duties - no\n               lifting + regular breaks.\n               Letter to OT requesting assessment of w/p (advise on duties can perform\n               etc.)\n\nWriting Task\n\nUsing the information in the case notes, write a letter to Mr Asad Iqbal, an Occupational\nTherapist detailing Mr Reed’s situation and requesting an assessment of his workplace.\nAddress the letter to Mr Asad Iqbal, Golders Park Occupational Health Centre, Bayview.", "extraction": "text"}]}